CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795877303
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI counter-sues Apple over alleged
OL,4,Atheft of trade secrets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA countersuit, filed in California on
OL,7,FFriday, alleged that Apple gained
OL,8,Fconfidential information through the
OL,9,Fhiring of a former OpenAI employee and
OL,10,Faccuses it of discouraging hardware
OL,11,Fsuppliers from working on future OpenAI
OL,12,Fdevices.
OL,14,FApple denied the counterclaims,
OL,15,Fdescribing them as "a transparent
OL,16,Fattempt to distract from the substance"
OL,17,Fof its own case.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
