OL,3,ACarly Rae Jepsen's viral hit proves
OL,4,Awhat fans knew all along
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor years, Carly Rae Jepsen's fans have
OL,7,Fbeen telling anyone who'll listen that
OL,8,Fshe wrote the perfect pop song... and
OL,9,Fthey don't mean Call Me Maybe.
OL,11,FNo, it's Run Away With Me ` three
OL,12,Fminutes of pure euphoria that captures
OL,13,Fthe moment a crush snowballs into a
OL,14,Ffull-blown love affair.
OL,16,FReleased in 2015, it stalled at number
OL,17,F58 in the charts, but it has long been
OL,18,Fa highlight of Jepsen's live shows.
OL,19,FThen, last week, it made a surprise
OL,20,Fappearance in Grand Theft Auto VI.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
