OL,3,AJake Bugg reflects on 'vulnerable' new
OL,4,Aalbum he almost didn't release
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The difficult part was deciding
OL,7,Fwhether to release it or not."
OL,9,FJake Bugg says writing his latest album
OL,10,Fwas an opportunity to explore loss,
OL,11,Fregrets and the lessons he has learned
OL,12,Falong the way.
OL,14,FAfter enjoying success with his
OL,15,Fself-titled debut album in 2012, the
OL,16,FNottingham singer says he has since
OL,17,Fstruggled to maintain relationships and
OL,18,Fended up feeling isolated.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
