OL,3,AActor and comedian PJ Gallagher dies
OL,4,Aaged 51
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaoiseach (Irish prime minster) Micheal
OL,7,FMartin has led tributes to comedian and
OL,8,Fbroadcaster PJ Gallagher, who has died
OL,9,Fat the age of 51.
OL,11,FBorn in Cork and adopted and raised in
OL,12,FDublin, Gallagher was a familiar
OL,13,Fpresence on television for more than
OL,14,Ftwo decades, appearing in numerous
OL,15,Fprogrammes, including BBC's The Young
OL,16,FOffenders.
OL,18,FHe first came to prominence in 2005,
OL,19,Fco-creating the RTE hidden-camera
OL,20,Fseries Naked Camera, which established
OL,21,Fhim as one of Ireland's best-known
OL,22,Fcomedy performers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
